---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// Left: the Kubernetes layout of the demo, one uvicorn process per pod and the
// Service spreading load. Right: `uvicorn --workers 2` in one container; the
// capture split 60 concurrent requests 22 / 38 between the two pids.
const W = 900, H = 300;
---
<figure class="bep12e">
  <div class="bep12e-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Two layouts. Left: a Service in front of three pods, each pod one uvicorn process; you scale by changing the replica count. Right: one container with a parent process and two uvicorn workers, which took 22 and 38 of 60 concurrent requests, an uneven split.">
    <text x="40" y="30" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>on Kubernetes: one process per pod</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>trên Kubernetes: mỗi pod một process</tspan></text>
    <rect x="40" y="110" width="112" height="56" rx="8" class="box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="network" x="64" y="138" size={22} />
    <text x="96" y="143" class="sm"><tspan data-lang-en>Service</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Service</tspan></text>
    {[0, 1, 2].map((i) => (
      <g>
        <line x1="152" y1="138" x2="190" y2={70 + i * 68} class="line" />
        <rect x="190" y={44 + i * 68} width="150" height="52" rx="8" class="box" />
        <DiagramIcon name="server" x="216" y={70 + i * 68} size={22} />
        <text x="244" y={66 + i * 68} class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>pod {i + 1}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>pod {i + 1}</tspan></text>
        <text x="244" y={84 + i * 68} class="sm"><tspan data-lang-en>1 uvicorn</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1 uvicorn</tspan></text>
      </g>
    ))}
    <text x="60" y="262" class="note"><tspan data-lang-en>scale = change replicas</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>muốn nhiều hơn = tăng replicas</tspan></text>
    <line x1="450" y1="40" x2="450" y2="270" class="axis" />
    <text x="490" y="30" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>one container: --workers 2</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>một container: --workers 2</tspan></text>
    <rect x="490" y="50" width="370" height="200" rx="10" class="box" />
    <rect x="520" y="70" width="140" height="44" rx="8" class="box inner" />
    <text x="590" y="97" text-anchor="middle" class="sm"><tspan data-lang-en>parent (supervisor)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>parent (giám sát)</tspan></text>
    <line x1="590" y1="114" x2="560" y2="146" class="line" />
    <line x1="590" y1="114" x2="730" y2="146" class="line" />
    <rect x="500" y="146" width="140" height="62" rx="8" class="box inner" />
    <DiagramIcon name="worker" x="526" y="168" size={22} />
    <text x="552" y="172" class="sm"><tspan data-lang-en>worker</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>worker</tspan></text>
    <text x="570" y="198" text-anchor="middle" class="val"><tspan data-lang-en>22 of 60</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>22 trên 60</tspan></text>
    <rect x="690" y="146" width="140" height="62" rx="8" class="box inner" />
    <DiagramIcon name="worker" x="716" y="168" size={22} />
    <text x="742" y="172" class="sm"><tspan data-lang-en>worker</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>worker</tspan></text>
    <text x="760" y="198" text-anchor="middle" class="val red"><tspan data-lang-en>38 of 60</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>38 trên 60</tspan></text>
    <text x="490" y="272" class="note"><tspan data-lang-en>the kernel hands connections out; the split is not even</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>kernel chia connection, không chia đều</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Inside a cluster, replicas already are your workers. The two-worker capture is what you get when one container does the job instead.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Trong cluster, các replica đã là worker của bạn. Capture hai worker là kết quả khi một container tự làm việc đó.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep12e { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep12e-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep12e svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 700px; height: auto; }
  .bep12e text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bep12e .h { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 15px; }
  .bep12e .t { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .bep12e .sm, .bep12e .note { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 13px; }
  .bep12e .val { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .bep12e text.red { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep12e .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep12e .box.inner { fill: var(--bg); }
  .bep12e .line { stroke: var(--text-faint); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .bep12e .axis { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 4 5; }
  .bep12e figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
